flowchart TD
    A[Open terminal page] --> B{Token in current page memory?}
    B -- No --> C[Operator selects Authenticate Hardware]
    C --> D[POST device ID to device-login]
    D --> E{Device exists and is active?}
    E -- No --> F[Show sign-in error]
    E -- Yes --> G[Return 12-hour token]
    G --> H[Keep token in React state]
    B -- Yes --> H
    H --> I[Show terminal modules]
    I --> J{Operator action}
    J --> K[Save today's rates]
    J --> L[Register customer]
    J --> M[Search phone and select customer]
    M --> N[Submit debt payment]
    K --> O[Protected API checks token and device]
    L --> O
    M --> O
    N --> O
    O --> P{Authorized?}
    P -- No --> Q[Show request error]
    P -- Yes --> R[Read or update PostgreSQL]
    R --> S[Return JSON result]
    S --> T[Update page status/results]
    R -. Payment error .-> U[Rollback payment transaction]
    U --> Q
